---
// Workflow / How it works
---

<section id="how" class="workflow-section">
  <div class="container-max">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <div class="badge badge-amber">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
        <span data-i18n="how.badge">工作流程</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="how.title">三步完成从阅读到精准分享</h2>
      <p class="section-desc" data-i18n="how.desc">
        丝滑融入你的日常浏览习惯，不打断思考节奏。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="workflow-grid">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="workflow-card">
        <div class="wf-top">
          <div class="wf-icon-box">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 11-6 6v3h3l6-6"/><path d="m22 2-2 2-4-4 2-2a2.828 2.828 0 1 1 4 4z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="wf-kicker" data-i18n="how.step1Kicker">01 · 划选高亮</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="wf-title" data-i18n="how.step1Title">选中文本，工具栏秒级浮现</h3>
        <p class="wf-desc" data-i18n="how.step1Desc">
          浏览文章时选中心仪文字，浮动栏随光标出现，支持 10 种柔和高亮色与自定义取色器。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="workflow-card">
        <div class="wf-top">
          <div class="wf-icon-box">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="9" y1="3" x2="9" y2="21"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="wf-kicker" data-i18n="how.step2Kicker">02 · 侧边栏沉淀</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="wf-title" data-i18n="how.step2Title">当前页面高亮集中管理</h3>
        <p class="wf-desc" data-i18n="how.step2Desc">
          点击侧边栏图标即可聚合本页全部高亮，支持一键点击定位原位、多选批量复制与序号标注。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="workflow-card">
        <div class="wf-top">
          <div class="wf-icon-box">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="wf-kicker" data-i18n="how.step3Kicker">03 · 精准直达</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="wf-title" data-i18n="how.step3Title">一键复制带段落锚点的链接</h3>
        <p class="wf-desc" data-i18n="how.step3Desc">
          点击分享按钮即可生成原生 Text Fragment 链接，让接收者一秒领会你的阅读重点。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .workflow-section {
    padding: 5.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .workflow-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .workflow-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .workflow-card {
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .workflow-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .wf-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .wf-icon-box {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .wf-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .wf-title {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .wf-desc {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
</style>
